div.p:
The old frontier between Galicia and Hungary along the crest of the Beskiden to
                    the point where it meets the watershed between the Novotnanka and the Zasihlanka
                    near point 967;

a line to be fixed on the ground passing between Hladovka and Vitanova, then
                    following generally the watershed between the Jelesna Voda on the east and the
                    Orawica on the west;
